       by construction (no BiomeDef entry exists to carry one). -->
  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase">
    <defName>RM_Vhorrin</defName>
    <label>vhorrin</label>
    <description>The murrin silhouette scaled wrong — arm-long, dorsal comb ragged, deep-bodied. It IS a pool fish, the same stock, grown past the point where the pen can hold anything else. Any stocked pool left crowded and unculled grows one; the murrin rings thin week by week until one wide slow ring is doing all the surfacing. It takes fingers.</description>
    <statBases>
      <MoveSpeed>2.0</MoveSpeed>
      <MarketValue>60</MarketValue>
      <ComfyTemperatureMin>5</ComfyTemperatureMin>
      <ComfyTemperatureMax>45</ComfyTemperatureMax>
